# .env.example
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is a TEMPLATE.  Do NOT put your real key here.
# Copy this file, rename the copy to  .env  and paste your real key.
#
# STEP-BY-STEP:
#   1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#   2. Sign in with your Google account (it is free).
#   3. Click "Create API Key" and copy the key.
#   4. Create a file called  .env  in the smartstudy_ai/ folder.
#   5. Paste the line below into that file, replacing the placeholder.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
